## 💊 **DRUG DISCOVERY PLATFORMS**

### 1. **KNIME Analytics Platform**
**What it does:** Visual workflow for drug discovery pipelines
- **Use Case:** Build complete drug discovery workflows without coding
- **Learning Curve:** 2-3 weeks
- **Real Application:** ADMET prediction, lead optimization
- **Download:** [https://www.knime.com](https://www.knime.com)
- **Nodes:** 2000+ tools for cheminformatics

### 2. **RDKit**
**What it does:** Cheminformatics and machine learning toolkit
- **Use Case:** Calculate molecular properties, fingerprints
- **Learning Curve:** 1 month (Python knowledge helpful)
- **Real Application:** Build AI models for drug activity
- **Install:** `pip install rdkit`
- **Power User:** Industry standard at pharma companies

### 3. **DeepChem**
**What it does:** Deep learning for drug discovery
- **Use Case:** Predict drug toxicity, solubility, activity
- **Learning Curve:** 1-2 months (Python/ML required)
- **Real Application:** Discover drugs 10x faster
- **Install:** `pip install deepchem`
- **Models:** Pre-trained on millions of molecules

### 4. **ChEMBL Database**
**What it does:** 2.2 million compounds with bioactivity data
- **Use Case:** Find all drugs for any disease
- **Learning Curve:** 1 week
- **Real Application:** Repurpose existing drugs
- **Access:** [https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/)
- **API:** Programmable access to all data

### 5. **PubChem**
**What it does:** World's largest free chemistry database
- **Use Case:** Find any molecule's properties and bioactivities
- **Learning Curve:** 2-3 days
- **Real Application:** Patent research, competitor analysis
- **Access:** [https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov](https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov)
- **Size:** 111 million compounds

