## 🔬 **PROTEIN STRUCTURE & FOLDING**

### 1. **AlphaFold (via ColabFold)**
**What it does:** AI-powered protein structure prediction
- **Use Case:** Get 3D structure from amino acid sequence
- **Learning Curve:** 3-4 days
- **Real Application:** Design drugs for previously undruggable proteins
- **Access:** [Google Colab notebooks - free GPU](https://github.com/sokrypton/ColabFold)
- **Revolution:** Nobel Prize 2024 technology

### 2. **MODELLER**
**What it does:** Homology modeling of protein structures
- **Use Case:** Build 3D models of drug targets
- **Learning Curve:** 2 weeks
- **Real Application:** Model mutant proteins in diseases
- **Download:** [https://salilab.org/modeller/](https://salilab.org/modeller/)
- **Output:** Publication-ready structures

### 3. **I-TASSER**
**What it does:** Automated protein structure prediction
- **Use Case:** Get structure when no template exists
- **Learning Curve:** 3-4 days
- **Real Application:** Novel viral protein structures
- **Access:** [https://zhanggroup.org/I-TASSER/](https://zhanggroup.org/I-TASSER/)
- **Accuracy:** Often better than X-ray crystallography

### 4. **Swiss-Model**
**What it does:** Automated homology modeling server
- **Use Case:** Quick protein structure generation
- **Learning Curve:** 1 day
- **Real Application:** Compare normal vs disease proteins
- **Access:** [https://swissmodel.expasy.org](https://swissmodel.expasy.org)
- **Feature:** Quality assessment included

### 5. **VMD (Visual Molecular Dynamics)**
**What it does:** Molecular dynamics visualization
- **Use Case:** Watch proteins move and interact with drugs
- **Learning Curve:** 2 weeks
- **Real Application:** See how drugs affect protein motion
- **Download:** [https://www.ks.uiuc.edu/Research/vmd/](https://www.ks.uiuc.edu/Research/vmd/)
- **Power:** Handle million-atom systems

