## 🚀 **QUICK START COMMANDS**

```bash
# Install Python-based tools
pip install rdkit deepchem pymol biopython scikit-learn

# Download databases
wget ftp://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/chembl/ChEMBLdb/latest/chembl.db

# Set up Conda environment
conda create -n drugdiscovery python=3.9
conda activate drugdiscovery
conda install -c conda-forge rdkit openbabel pymol

# Docker containers for complex tools
docker pull argonaute/autodock-vina
docker pull biocontainers/blast
```

